  "adaptations": [
    "Restore source fullscreen custom chart creation/editing with canonical axis identities, category/search/unit choices, optional right axis, manual names and Save Chart footer.",
    "New charts use the saved mobile source default: Weight/kg, seven days, visible. Existing days, visibility, cycle state and unrecorded historical metric identities survive edits.",
    "Populate the complete source-supported biometric catalog/unit choices at the server projection boundary; do not invent units for catalog definitions whose units are unknown.",
    "Keep unsent drafts transient. Cancel/back preserves the previous view; reused live navigation actions do not create another route owner.",
    "Persist immutable cloud command envelopes through dropped replies and 5xx errors. A confirmed 4xx rejection releases the envelope; conflict exposes explicit reload of latest saved chart.",
    "Custom details now use the shared source controller with confirmation; see chart-detail-source.json.",
    "No schema, domain calculation or CGM controller changes."
  ],
